%p
  The donor levels import of
  %b= @filestore.file_name
  has finished.
%ul
  %li Constituents in file: #{@counts[:rows]}
  %li Customer records updated: #{@counts[:updated] + @counts[:cleared]}
  %li Update errors: #{@error_count}
%ul
  %li Unchanged: #{@counts[:unchanged]}
  %li Rows without an External constituent ID: #{@counts[:blank_id]}
  %li Customers cleared because they were not in the file: #{@counts[:cleared_absent]}
%p
  - if @result_file
    The attached file
    %b= @result_file.file_name
    lists the rows with errors.
  - else
    No rows had errors.
